            "description": "Returns the enhanced transcript when available, otherwise the original transcript. An unavailable transcript is represented by a successful response with available set to false and its current processing status.\n\nRequires both the `meetings.read` and `transcriptions.read` scopes.\n\n`meeting_id` is filled in by **List completed meetings**, so run that first — or paste an id (`mtg_…`) into the environment."
          },
          "response": []
